# Pulse AI

Before non-trivial work, read `docs/HANDOFF.md` and (if touching scouts) `docs/SCOUT_OPS.md`.

## Hard rules
- Russian replies to the user unless they write in English.
- Never commit secrets (`application-local.yaml`, sidecar `.env`, `accounts*.json` with real keys, `sessions/`).
- Scout: 1 bought account = 1 slot = 1 session = 1 sticky proxy. Never reuse tdata/auth_key across two scout IDs.
- PARSER/OBSERVER: no DMs, no SpamBot. SENDER/OUTREACH: SpamBot ≤ 4/day.
- Group joins only via chat pool queue (~30s), not bulk join loops.
- Local Flyway is off: patch `H2LocalSchemaPatcher` when adding schema.
- Agreed next feature: archive backfill + join matrix are in; see HANDOFF §7.

## Stack reminder
Java Spring Boot bot+admin (:8081) + Python Telethon sidecar (:8090).
